# Citation metadata (Citation File Format 1.2.0, https://citation-file-format.github.io/).
# GitHub shows it as "Cite this repository". Zenodo reads .zenodo.json instead
# when both are present: keep the two in step.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use openclare, please cite it as below. If you use the results of the
  research note on closing edge loops, please cite the note as well (listed
  under references).
type: software
title: "openclare: automatic quad retopology"
abstract: >-
  Automatic quad retopology for Blender: a mesh of triangles in, a mesh of
  quads out, its edges following the shape. An open-source engine written in
  Rust, with a Blender add-on, a bench comparing it with other remeshers, and
  research notes with machine-checked proofs in Lean.
authors:
